<phrase>
    <source>To install the plugin qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;Visit  :&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://pypi.python.org/pypi/qet-tb-generator&apos;&gt;qet-tb-generator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; First install on macOSX&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Install, if required, python 3.11 bundle only, &lt;a href=&apos;https://www.python.org/ftp/python/3.11.2/python-3.11.2-macos11.pkg&apos;&gt;python-3.11.2-macos11.pkg&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;2 Run Profile.command script&lt;br&gt;because program use hardcoded PATH for localise qet-tb-generator plugin &lt;br&gt; Visit :&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://qelectrotech.org/forum/viewtopic.php?pid=5674#p5674&apos;&gt;howto&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. pip3 install qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; Update on macOSX&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt; pip3 install --upgrade qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;</source>
    <target>qet_tb_generator залгуурыг суулгахын тулд&lt;br&gt;Зочлох  :&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://pypi.python.org/pypi/qet-tb-generator&apos;&gt;qet-tb-generator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; macOSX дээр анх удаа суулгах&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Шаардлагатай бол зөвхөн python 3.11 багцыг суулгана, &lt;a href=&apos;https://www.python.org/ftp/python/3.11.2/python-3.11.2-macos11.pkg&apos;&gt;python-3.11.2-macos11.pkg&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Profile.command скриптийг ажиллуулна&lt;br&gt;учир нь програм qet-tb-generator залгуурыг олохын тулд хатуу кодлосон PATH-г ашигладаг &lt;br&gt; Зочлох :&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://qelectrotech.org/forum/viewtopic.php?pid=5674#p5674&apos;&gt;howto&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. pip3 install qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; macOSX дээр шинэчлэх&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt; pip3 install --upgrade qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;</target>
</phrase>
<phrase>
    <source>To install the plugin qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;Visit :&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://pypi.python.org/pypi/qet-tb-generator&apos;&gt;qet-tb-generator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Requires python 3.5 or above.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; First install on Linux&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. check you have pip3 installed: pip3 --version&lt;br&gt;If not install with: sudo apt-get install python3-pip&lt;br&gt;2. Install the program: sudo pip3 install qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;3. Run the program: qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; Update on Linux&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt;sudo pip3 install --upgrade qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;</source>
    <target>qet_tb_generator залгуурыг суулгахын тулд&lt;br&gt;Зочлох :&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://pypi.python.org/pypi/qet-tb-generator&apos;&gt;qet-tb-generator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Python 3.5 буюу түүнээс дээш хувилбар шаардлагатай.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; Linux дээр анх удаа суулгах&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. pip3 суулгасан эсэхийг шалгана: pip3 --version&lt;br&gt;Хэрэв суулгаагүй бол: sudo apt-get install python3-pip&lt;br&gt;2. Программыг суулгана: sudo pip3 install qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;3. Программыг ажиллуулна: qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; Linux дээр шинэчлэх&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt;sudo pip3 install --upgrade qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;</target>
</phrase>
<phrase>
    <source>To install the plugin qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;Visit :&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://pypi.python.org/pypi/qet-tb-generator&apos;&gt;qet-tb-generator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Requires python 3.5 or above.&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; First install on Windows&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Install, if required, python 3.5 or above&lt;br&gt; Visit :&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://www.python.org/downloads/&apos;&gt;python.org&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. pip install qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; Update on Windows&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt;python -m pip install --upgrade qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;&gt;&gt;user could launch in a terminal this script in this directory&lt;br&gt; C:\users\XXXX\AppData\Local\Programs\Python\Python36-32\Scripts   &lt;br&gt;</source>
    <target>qet_tb_generator залгуурыг суулгахын тулд&lt;br&gt;Зочлох :&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://pypi.python.org/pypi/qet-tb-generator&apos;&gt;qet-tb-generator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Python 3.5 буюу түүнээс дээш хувилбар шаардлагатай.&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; Windows дээр анх удаа суулгах&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Шаардлагатай бол Python 3.5 буюу түүнээс дээш хувилбарыг суулгана&lt;br&gt; Зочлох :&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://www.python.org/downloads/&apos;&gt;python.org&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. pip install qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;U&gt; Windows дээр шинэчлэх&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;br&gt;python -m pip install --upgrade qet_tb_generator&lt;br&gt;&gt;&gt;хэрэглэгч терминал дээр энэ скриптийг энэ хавтаснаас ажиллуулж болно&lt;br&gt; C:\users\XXXX\AppData\Local\Programs\Python\Python36-32\Scripts   &lt;br&gt;</target>
</phrase>
